<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Shelfmark: stock for independent bookshops</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="logo" href="#">Shelfmark</a>
    <nav class="site-nav">
      <a href="#">Features</a>
      <a href="#">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#">Shops using it</a>
      <a class="nav-signin" href="#">Sign in</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Know what is on your shelves before a customer asks</h1>
        <p>Shelfmark counts every copy as it is sold, ordered, or returned, and tells you which titles to reorder on Monday morning.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#">Start a 30-day trial</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="#">See how it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="preview" aria-label="Stock list preview">
        <div class="preview-head">
          <span>Reorder this week</span>
          <span class="preview-date">Mon 9 June</span>
        </div>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Title</th><th>On shelf</th><th>Sold this week</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>The Salt Road</td><td>1</td><td>9</td></tr>
            <tr><td>A Year of Hedges</td><td>0</td><td>6</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Small Engines</td><td>2</td><td>7</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Notes from the Ferry</td><td>1</td><td>5</td></tr>
            <tr><td>The Glass Orchard</td><td>0</td><td>4</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="facts">
      <p><span class="fact-title">Works with your till.</span> Sales come in from the shop's card reader as they happen.</p>
      <p><span class="fact-title">Orders from your distributor.</span> One click sends the reorder list in the format they take.</p>
      <p><span class="fact-title">Returns tracked.</span> Unsold copies due back are listed by date.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
@font-face {
  font-family: "Inter";
  font-weight: 400;
  src: url("fonts/inter-latin-400-normal.woff2") format("woff2");
}

@font-face {
  font-family: "Inter";
  font-weight: 500;
  src: url("fonts/inter-latin-500-normal.woff2") format("woff2");
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: #2a2622;
  background: #fffdf9;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
}

.site-header {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 18px 64px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ece6dc;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.site-nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.site-nav a {
  margin-left: 28px;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #5c544b;
}

.site-nav .nav-signin {
  padding: 10px 22px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #8a3b24;
  color: #ffffff;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.hero {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 64px;
  padding: 64px 64px 48px;
}

.hero-text {
  max-width: 540px;
}

h1 {
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  font-size: 40px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.hero-text p {
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  color: #5c544b;
}

.actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
}

.button {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.button-primary {
  border: 1px solid #d6cec2;
  background: #f3eee6;
  color: #5c544b;
}

.button-secondary {
  border: 1px solid #d6cec2;
  background: #fffdf9;
  color: #5c544b;
}

.preview {
  flex: 0 0 480px;
  border: 1px solid #ece6dc;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #ffffff;
}

.preview-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 14px 18px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #ece6dc;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.preview-date {
  color: #8a8178;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 14px;
}

table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 14px;
}

th,
td {
  padding: 9px 18px;
  text-align: left;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #f3eee6;
}

th {
  color: #8a8178;
  font-weight: 400;
}

tbody tr:last-child td {
  border-bottom: none;
}

.facts {
  display: flex;
  gap: 40px;
  padding: 8px 64px 0;
}

.facts p {
  flex: 1;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: #5c544b;
}

.fact-title {
  color: #2a2622;
  font-weight: 500;
}
